'''Hoard of Discovery''' is a freebie available from October 30th through November 26th, 2024, as part of the [[Year of the Dragon]] event. It can be claimed on one character per account from [[Estraz]] after claiming it from [[Xatheral]]; since the box and its contents are all {{Bind|BtA|BoA}}, it can then be passed around on that character's server via the Account Bank. Double-click it to receive free rewards:
* 1 Greater {{Item|Elixir of Discovery}}
* 1 {{Item|Complete Reincarnation Timer Reset}}
* 1 Sovereign II {{Item|Experience Elixir}}
* One of the following pets:
** [[Tan-stripe Pseudodragon]]
** [[Snowy Owlbear]]

